
# ^ Subject: imperative mood, under 70 characters, no trailing period.
#   "Add --no-external so a fake $HOME actually sandboxes the run"
#   not "Added flag", not "fix: add flag", not "Updates to main.rs".
#
# Body below, wrapped at 72. Explain WHY, not what — the diff already shows
# what. What was broken or missing, what you observed, what you decided, and
# what you ruled out and why. `git log` is the design record for this repo: it
# should tell whoever reads it at 2am why the code looks the way it does.
#
# Worth writing down when it applies:
#   - a number you measured, and on what machine
#   - an approach you tried that was worse, so nobody re-adds it
#   - for a new cache target: the command that regenerates it
#   - for a safety rule: the case it refuses, and what happens without it
